                    io::ErrorKind::InvalidInput,
                    "could not resolve to any address",
                )
            }))
        })();
        let _ = tx.send(result);
    });
    let result = match rx.recv_timeout(NETWORK_TIMEOUT) {
        Ok(result) => result,
        Err(_) => Err(io::Error::from(io::ErrorKind::TimedOut)),
    };
